  text:
    en: What is the main component of Polish air in winter?
    native: "Jaki jest g\u0142\xF3wny sk\u0142adnik polskiego powietrza zim\u0105?"
  visual: {fileID: 0}
  useImageAnswers: 0
  answers:
  - text:
      en: Oxygen
      native: Tlen
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Smog
      native: Smog
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 1
  - text:
      en: Lavender Scent
      native: Zapach lawendy
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  - text:
      en: Hope
      native: Nadzieja
    image: {fileID: 0}
    isCorrect: 0
  explanation:
    en: During winter, some Polish cities have worse air quality than Beijing. We
      call it 'Polish Gold'.
    native: "Zim\u0105 niekt\xF3re polskie miasta maj\u0105 gorsze powietrze ni\u017C
      Pekin. Nazywamy to 'Polskim Z\u0142otem'."
